<mxCell id="notes" value="Read with the three detail pages: Authentication; Tokens and Authorization; Audit and Logging. Arrows show data transfers; security helpers are invoked by controllers.&#xa;Implementation limits: invalid/missing-token branches currently clear cache but leave AUTHENTICATION_FAILURE commented out. Permission checks are conditional; default accessType is NONE.&#xa;Audit coverage observed: POST /AA/Login. Token expiry duration and stored-procedure internals are not present in this repository. React storage and hosting are unspecified." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=14;spacing=12;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1440" width="1720" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
