<mxCell id="notes" value="Token format is custom, not a JWT. API-token provisioning is not shown because it is not implemented in the inspected login flow.&#xa;Login token checking passes validateBothToken=false; AuthenticationHelper switches it to true if a usertoken is supplied.&#xa;Current-code limit: IsValidToken clears cache for missing/invalid tokens but does not set an authentication failure. Credential and application-access failures do set response errors." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=14;spacing=12;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1250" width="1720" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
